---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import CommercialAnalytics from '../components/CommercialAnalytics.astro';
import { faqItems } from '../data/commercial';
import { pageLastmods } from '../data/pageLastmods';
import '../styles/commercial-pages.css';
const origin = new URL('/', Astro.site || Astro.url.origin).origin;
const canonical = new URL('/faq/', origin).toString();
const schema = [{ '@context': 'https://schema.org', '@type': 'FAQPage', '@id': canonical, url: canonical, mainEntity: faqItems.map((item) => ({ '@type': 'Question', name: item.question, acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: item.answer } })), dateModified: pageLastmods.commercial, inLanguage: 'id-ID' }, { '@context': 'https://schema.org', '@type': 'BreadcrumbList', itemListElement: [{ '@type': 'ListItem', position: 1, name: 'Beranda', item: origin + '/' }, { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 2, name: 'FAQ', item: canonical }] }];
---
<BaseLayout title="FAQ RAMUNI: Harga, Trial, Data, dan AI" description="Jawaban umum tentang harga, trial, data, AI, dan penggunaan RAMUNI untuk UMKM." canonical="/faq/" schema={schema}>
  <div class="commercial-page" data-commercial-page="faq"><section class="commercial-hero"><div class="container commercial-hero__grid"><div><Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Beranda', href: '/' }, { label: 'FAQ' }]} /><p class="section-kicker">Pertanyaan umum</p><h1>Jawaban yang jelas sebelum Anda melangkah.</h1></div><div class="commercial-hero__aside"><p>Harga, trial, data, AI, dan kecocokan paket dijelaskan dengan status yang bisa dipertanggungjawabkan.</p><a class="button button--primary" href="/tour-produk-gratis/?flow=consultation" data-analytics-event="demo_request" data-analytics-location="faq_hero" data-destination="tour">Tanyakan ke tim</a></div></div></section><section class="commercial-section commercial-section--white"><div class="container faq-layout"><header><p class="section-kicker">FAQ RAMUNI</p><h2>Masih punya pertanyaan yang belum terjawab?</h2><p style="margin-top:18px;color:var(--ink-72)">Jika kebutuhan Anda tidak ada di sini, isi kontak singkat melalui sesi coba gratis. Jangan kirim data pelanggan atau informasi sensitif.</p></header><div class="faq-list">{faqItems.map((item, index) => <details data-faq-question={`faq-${index + 1}`}><summary>{item.question}</summary><p>{item.answer}</p></details>)}</div></div></section><section class="commercial-section"><div class="container"><div class="commercial-cta"><div><p class="section-kicker">Belum menemukan jawaban?</p><h2>Lihat alur yang paling dekat dengan usaha Anda.</h2><p>Mulai dari satu masalah dan biarkan tim mengarahkan langkah berikutnya.</p></div><div class="commercial-cta__actions"><a class="button button--primary" href="/tour-produk-gratis/?flow=trial" data-analytics-event="free_trial_click" data-analytics-location="faq_final" data-destination="tour">Coba gratis</a><a class="button button--secondary" href="/pricing/">Lihat harga</a></div></div></div></section></div><CommercialAnalytics />
</BaseLayout>
